  "goodToKnow": "Das Andenken is a souvenir or keepsake (ein Andenken an den Urlaub) and also remembrance: zum Andenken an meine Großmutter, jemandes Andenken ehren (to honour someone's memory). For tourist trinkets, Germans also say das Souvenir, and der Andenkenladen is a souvenir shop. It's a nominalised verb, an + denken (to think of). Das Gedenken is more solemn commemoration. The plural is unchanged: die Andenken."
